## Evolution log

| Date | Change | Insight |
|---|---|---|
| 2026-08-16 | Declared relationship structurally first and observation operationally first. | The ontology needed two meanings of “first” to preserve both depth and usability. |
| 2026-08-16 | Elevated time and gravity to field primitives. | Trajectory and pull make the living topology visible without turning metaphor into physics. |
| 2026-08-16 | Separated research inheritance from YAWN’s extension. | Attribution strengthens originality; it does not diminish it. |
| 2026-08-16 | Defined one source object with Relationship, Agent, and Arena Views. | High resolution becomes navigable when depth is recoverable from a stable compression spine. |
